# What a deployment is, stated explicitly.
#
# `vercel --prod` uploads from this working directory, and this machine also
# edits demo footage in it — a 113 MB walkthrough render in demo/out is a
# legitimate local artifact and an illegitimate upload. The 100 MB per-file
# limit turned that mistake into a hard deploy failure, which is the only
# reason it was noticed; this file makes the boundary deliberate instead of
# incidental.

demo
renders
samples
.render
.render-tmp
.smoke
.piper-models
docs
_ref
scratchpad
public/preview
public/__smoke
public/__cards
*.log
